Package: linux-binary-7.1.5+deb14-amd64
Architecture: amd64
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.linux.nokernel !pkg.linux.quick>
Built-Using: linux (= 7.1.5-1)
Depends: linux-base-7.1.5+deb14-amd64 (= @signedtemplate_binaryversion@), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Linux 7.1.5 for 64-bit PCs (kernel image)
 This package contains the kernel image for Linux 7.1.5 on PCs with AMD64,
 Intel 64 or VIA Nano processors.
 .
 This does not provide a complete kernel installation.  You should normally
 install linux-image-7.1.5+deb14-amd64.

